{
  "uid": "king-teenpatti-game",
  "title": "King Teen Patti — Game",
  "description": "Players, tables, games started/completed/abandoned, moves, invalid moves, timeouts, kicks, chat, chips paid out (Requirement 35c). One row of the combined Game Server dashboard, generated by split_dashboards.py — edit king-teenpatti.json, not this file.",
